    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will play as Tom, struggling with a moment of crisis in his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hotel he owns and runs with his beautiful girlfriend Samuela is facing bankruptcy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956600/extras/7f4b50c65c5a36a661e9c7517e8e95f4.avif?t=1748281476\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure from her family leads her to take a period of reflection in their relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucine, Tom's best friend, remains by his side, however, when everything seems to fall apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956600/extras/1e3be9ef3bcf38dee38decb6172c0086.avif?t=1748281476\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a strange fellow arrives at the hotel with a proposal that Tom cannot refuse....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And after him will come many gorgeous girls, Olympic athletes from Sweden, who will stay at the hotel for a month, under the care of the beautiful but very tough manager Miss Inga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956600/extras/79f9e34443ef5f639fe8fcf70c26b07b.avif?t=1748281476\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We don't want to spoil the surprise too much, so the plot description ends here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956600/extras/7653e31356993f9ec7a10f22817ffe06.avif?t=1748281476\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is based on a system of choices that will affect the development of the plot, change the characteristics of the main character, and unlock a rich gallery of achievements, as well as numerous alternative endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956600/extras/2196abb05193d9bf270f0f544522eb1f.avif?t=1748281476\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just have to download the most updated release and immerse yourself in the storyline of PERV'S HOTEL, Lust from Sweden!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956600/extras/cb00905cc35499004eb0add3f5fda4db.avif?t=1748281476\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The actual release includes the followeing stuff:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Images: 2500+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations: 55+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words: 33000+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices: 110+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements: 330+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956600/extras/937f92fbfc507b0c6879c5ee27e45817.avif?t=1748281476\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956600/extras/28ceaa080a7aee2d0a24936b9ba7d55e.avif?t=1748281476\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>",
